   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Second Shift: reliability design",
   "originalText": "Second Shift: reliability design",
   "fontSize": 34,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-071",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 84,
   "width": 1305.6,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 130286598,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570152712,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every write is recorded before and after it happens, retried safely, and read back. Every risk below has a mechanism and a test.",
   "originalText": "Every write is recorded before and after it happens, retried safely, and read back. Every risk below has a mechanism and a test.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-072",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 136,
   "width": 731.4,
   "height": 28.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1506442652,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 664876774,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1.  Each external write is a row in the SQLite ledger",
   "originalText": "1.  Each external write is a row in the SQLite ledger",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-073",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 168,
   "width": 844.8,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1389698625,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1241130074,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One stable key per write. Status: planned (no row yet), pending, retrying, done, failed.",
   "originalText": "One stable key per write. Status: planned (no row yet), pending, retrying, done, failed.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-074",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 668,
   "width": 960.0,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2132657286,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1462945690,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A failed write stops the run. Later writes are not attempted, and the plan shows failed, never done.",
   "originalText": "A failed write stops the run. Later writes are not attempted, and the plan shows failed, never done.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-075",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 692,
   "width": 1180.8,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1765070035,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 957006265,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Crash-resume never duplicates: the provider is asked first, so each job is booked once and each email or post is sent once.",
   "originalText": "Crash-resume never duplicates: the provider is asked first, so each job is booked once and each email or post is sent once.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-076",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 756,
   "width": 690.0,
   "height": 28.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 611164248,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1538946474,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2.  Each plan has one status, stored with the plan",
   "originalText": "2.  Each plan has one status, stored with the plan",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-077",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 788,
   "width": 1065.6,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 828480808,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1904904517,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Only a rule-checked plan that is still fresh when the dispatcher approves can write. A simulation never writes.",
   "originalText": "Only a rule-checked plan that is still fresh when the dispatcher approves can write. A simulation never writes.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-078",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1206,
   "width": 921.6,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1435920784,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 745188127,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Approve on a done plan returns it unchanged. Approve on a stale or rejected plan writes nothing.",
   "originalText": "Approve on a done plan returns it unchanged. Approve on a stale or rejected plan writes nothing.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-079",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1230,
   "width": 1382.4,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 48453508,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2020027419,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What-if (\"what if Wei doesn't show up?\") runs the full plan and checks and replies with the impact. GET /api/whatif/scan does it for every tech.",
   "originalText": "What-if (\"what if Wei doesn't show up?\") runs the full plan and checks and replies with the impact. GET /api/whatif/scan does it for every tech.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-080",
